
1. Remove duplicate `media/`
2. Use `chats/firebase_chat.json` instead of `./chats/firebase_chat.json`
3. Add `.firebase/` if you also want to ignore Firebase local cache folder

Use this final `.gitignore`:

```gitignore
# Database
db.sqlite3
*.sqlite3
*.db

# Environment files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Firebase
.firebase/
chats/firebase_chat.json
firebase-debug.log

# Media uploads
media/
uploads/

# Python / Django
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.log
local_settings.py

# Virtual environment
venv/
env/
.venv/

# Static files generated
staticfiles/
collected_static/

# IDE / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db